flowchart TD
    A[User browses problem catalog] --> B[Opens a problem detail page]
    B --> C["Backend introspects problem_&lt;id&gt; schema<br/>renders sample tables in UI"]
    C --> D[User writes SQL in editor, clicks Run]
    D --> E{Single SELECT statement?}
    E -- No --> F[Reject: show error, nothing executed]
    E -- Yes --> G["Connect as practice_runner role<br/>SET search_path TO problem_&lt;id&gt;"]
    G --> H[Execute user's query]
    G --> I[Execute problem.solution_sql]
    H --> J{Result sets match?}
    I --> J
    J -- Yes --> K[Mark correct]
    J -- No --> L[Mark incorrect]
    K --> M[Log Submission record]
    L --> M
    M --> N[Return JSON feedback]
    N --> O[JS renders result table + correct/incorrect state]
    O --> P{User wants more?}
    P -- Hint --> Q[Show problem.hint]
    P -- Reveal solution --> R[Show problem.solution_sql]
    P -- Done --> S[Catalog's solved badge updates from Submission history]
